{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07121","headline":"余干夜宴奉饯前苏州韦使君新除婺州作 · 刘长卿","name":"余干夜宴奉饯前苏州韦使君新除婺州作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"复拜东阳郡，遥驰北阙心。\n行春五马急，向夜一猨深。\n山过康郎近，星看婺女临。\n幸容栖托分，犹恋旧棠阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}